; Handler of the word "all" (also "everything")
;
; Records that ALL was typed: AllStage becomes 1, unless "except" has been
; seen already (2). The state is cleared at the start of each phrase (#R$785F).
; Then goes on with the next word.
; .
; Hardware: none.
@label=WordAll
c$82D2 LD A,($B719)
@isub=CP ALL_STATE_EXCEPT
 $82D5 CP $02
 $82D7 JP Z,$75B4
@isub=LD A,ALL_STATE_ALL
 $82DA LD A,$01
 $82DC LD ($B719),A
 $82DF JP $75B4
